<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,421 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,421 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,421 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,420 on Wednesday. Dealers said the central bank sold $1.20 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 10		  Oct 9</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,421		   5,420</p>
<p> Volume traded (mln $)	15.30		   2.90</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
